WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:06.060
Gunshots echo down the concrete hallway of
Site-22.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.330
Screams are the only thing that escape each
room.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:13.200
A team of men in all black combat gear and
masks move from one section of the complex

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.200
to the next.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.020
Pietro Wilson hides in his office, listening
to the cries for mercy of his colleagues.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.590
He shakes uncontrollably with fear.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:22.900
Who are they? he thinks.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.330
Why are they killing everyone and how did
they find us?

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:30.289
Moments earlier Pietro Wilson had been in
the canteen eating dinner with other staff

00:00:30.289 --> 00:00:31.289
members.

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:33.190
A group of heavily armed men entered the room.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:35.809
They stood silently surveying the area.

00:00:35.809 --> 00:00:38.510
One of the scientists stood up and asked if
they could assist them.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.359
That’s when the carnage started.

00:00:40.359 --> 00:00:43.929
One of the masked men raised his rifle and
shot the scientists in the head.

00:00:43.929 --> 00:00:48.500
Chaos broke out as the other mercenaries raised
their weapons and began firing.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.760
Bullets flew everywhere and Pietro was lucky
not to be struck or trampled as he escaped

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:55.030
out the back door of the cafeteria.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:58.609
He ran to his office, slammed the door shut,
and hid under his desk.

00:00:58.609 --> 00:01:04.390
Now he sits on the floor with his legs pulled
up to his chest shaking uncontrollably.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:09.390
After a couple of minutes he manages to take
a deep breath and slows his heart rate.

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:14.400
He regains control of his body, but is still
filled with fear and adrenaline.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.910
Pietro crawls on his belly to his office door.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.190
He reaches up and pulls down on the handle.

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:21.820
There is a slight click as the latch releases.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:25.350
He opens the door just a crack and peers out
into the hallway.

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:30.160
The flickering emergency lights illuminate
the corridor for a few seconds at a time before

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:32.000
plunging it back into darkness.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.980
There is no one in sight, but from around
the corner flashes of light from machine gun

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:38.720
fire flickers down the hall.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:42.690
The screams of the workers at Site-22 are
silenced.

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:45.800
Pietro takes a deep breath and pushes the
door open further.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:49.909
He crawls out of his office and starts moving
away from the violence.

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:55.700
Unfortunately, to get away from the mayhem
he must go deeper into the bowels of Site-22.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:02:00.290
The exit is the other way, but he is too scared
to head towards the armed men.

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:03.750
He stands up and brushes the dirt from his
blue technician jumpsuit.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:06.830
The lights flicker off, the hallway goes dark.

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:10.649
He reaches out his hands and comes into contact
with the cool damp wall.

00:02:10.649 --> 00:02:14.629
He feels his way down the corridor, swimming
in darkness.

00:02:14.629 --> 00:02:17.549
After a few moments the lights flicker back
on.

00:02:17.549 --> 00:02:21.439
Pietro looks over his shoulder to make sure
he is still in the clear.

00:02:21.439 --> 00:02:25.700
Standing at the end of the hall is a soldier
dressed in all black with a mask covering

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:26.700
his face.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.420
The soldier stands motionless.

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:33.969
Pietro turns to face the soldier, his eyes
open wide, his heart races, he can’t breath.

00:02:33.969 --> 00:02:35.099
The figure doesn’t move.

00:02:35.099 --> 00:02:40.060
Then the lights flicker out again and Pietro
pushes off the wall and runs, blind in the

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:41.060
darkness.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:45.620
He sprints as fast as he can when suddenly
there is a loud crack and a bullet whizzes

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:46.709
by his head.

00:02:46.709 --> 00:02:49.420
He can feel the wind as it barely misses his
cheek.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:50.780
He continues to run.

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:53.810
The lights flicker back on, he peers over
his shoulder.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:58.560
Now there is an entire group of armed men
pursuing him down the hallway, guns raised.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:02.770
He turns the corner of the hallway and proceeds
down a set of stairs further into Site-22.

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:07.799
At the bottom of the stairway there is a short
corridor with a door at the end of it.

00:03:07.799 --> 00:03:09.669
There’s nowhere else to go.

00:03:09.669 --> 00:03:11.989
He pulls a key card out of his pocket and
fumbles it.

00:03:11.989 --> 00:03:13.640
The card falls to the ground.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:18.170
Pietro bends down to pick it up and as he
leans over a bullet whizzes past where his

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.590
head had just been.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:22.209
The projectile embeds itself into the metal
door.

00:03:22.209 --> 00:03:25.669
He scoops his key card up off the ground and
shoves it against the scanner.

00:03:25.669 --> 00:03:28.569
The door unlocks and he dashes into the room.

00:03:28.569 --> 00:03:30.650
He quickly turns and shuts the door.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.019
It locks automatically.

00:03:32.019 --> 00:03:35.769
The last thing he sees is the assassins running
towards the door.

00:03:35.769 --> 00:03:38.639
The lights flicker on in the room where Pietro
stands.

00:03:38.639 --> 00:03:42.700
The room has only one door, no windows, and
no vents.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.999
It is completely isolated.

00:03:43.999 --> 00:03:48.249
In the middle of the room is SCP-5000.

00:03:48.249 --> 00:03:53.290
He knew there was a SCP in this room that
was designated SCP-5000, but he never knew

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.450
what it actually was.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.629
Here he is now, staring at it.

00:03:56.629 --> 00:04:00.540
A strange looking mechanical harness hanging
in the middle of the room.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.510
Suddenly, loud banging at the door fills the
room.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.249
The armed men are trying to break in.

00:04:05.249 --> 00:04:08.169
It is only a matter of time before they pry
the door open.

00:04:08.169 --> 00:04:11.470
With nowhere to go Pietro Wilson knows that
he is dead.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:14.169
He looks at SCP-5000 and shakes his head.

00:04:14.169 --> 00:04:16.669
“What do I have to lose?” he says out
loud.

00:04:16.669 --> 00:04:19.440
Only your life, a voice inside his head responds.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:23.280
He walks over to SCP-5000 and pulls it down
from where it's hanging.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.410
It is heavy.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:27.630
On the mechanical suit are symbols he does
not recognize.

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:31.580
The only things he knows about the suit are
rumors he’s heard from others who work at

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.580
Site-22.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:37.040
Supposedly, it first appeared in a flash of
light in the containment chamber of a Keter

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.850
level SCP at Site-62C.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:43.270
The designation of this Keter was SCP-579.

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:48.290
The only other thing that Pietro knows is
that everyone at Site-62C was slaughtered

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.470
when containment was breached.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:54.490
SCP-5000 was found deactivated next to a pile
of bodies.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:05:00.690
He slips on the harness and Ss if it has a
life of its own, SCP-5000 begins to adjust

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.620
itself to the exact dimensions of his body.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:08.460
The suit grows and snakes across his skin,
wrapping every appendage in armor.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:09.720
Then it begins to tighten.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:13.720
Pietro Wilson starts to scream as SCP-5000
envelops him.

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:20.310
The suit rises up the back of his neck and
encases his entire head, silencing his screams.

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:23.430
The door to the room blasts open from a controlled
explosion.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:26.670
As the dust and smoke settles the masked men
enter the room.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:30.580
Their flashlights move from side to side as
they search for the elusive technician who

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:31.750
had just entered.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.030
There is no one in the room.

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:36.510
All that is there is an empty rack in the
middle of the chamber.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:38.810
The men fan out, but there is no other exit.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.810
The room is just a solid square of concrete.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:41.810
They are baffled.

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:43.970
“Where did he go?” one of them shouts.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:48.060
Pietro Wilson had blacked out from the pain
of the suit attaching to his body.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:51.090
He comes to still standing in the middle of
the room.

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:53.190
All around him are men in black combat gear.

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:54.820
They are searching for him.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:56.650
He holds his breath and closes his eyes.

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:58.820
But the gun shots never come.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:00.440
He opens one of his eyes and looks around.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:03.031
Why haven’t they killed me yet? he thinks.

00:06:03.031 --> 00:06:06.810
He slowly turns his head as men walk by him
with their guns raised.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:08.920
He hears someone say, “where did he go?”

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:10.380
I’m right here, he thinks.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.380
Am I dead?

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:14.930
Pietro looks down to see that his entire body
is contained within SCP-5000.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.560
He lifts his hand and waves it in front of
his face.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:23.240
He is still clearly alive, but it seems as
if the killers can’t see him.

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:27.490
He walks up to one of the mercenaries and
waves his hand in front of the man’s face.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:28.810
There is no reaction.

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:31.270
The suit made me invisible, he thinks.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:35.150
Pietro looks at one of the men to see if he
can find out who they are and why they have

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:36.830
killed everyone at the base.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.670
On the sleeve of the man’s jacket are the
words Zeta-19.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:44.270
He’s never heard of Zeta-19 before, but
they must be a part of an organization that

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.960
is trying to undermine the SCP Foundation.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:51.180
The men continue to search the empty room,
clearly confused as to where the technician

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.180
went.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:55.670
Pietro weaves his way through the group of
men and back out the door he had entered from.

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:59.200
On his way through the wreckage that used
to be a door, Pietro Wilson trips on some

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.200
debris.

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:02.620
He reaches out to steady himself, but he is
falling.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:06.660
He closes his eyes knowing that as soon as
he hits the ground all of the men hunting

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:09.310
him will be alerted by the sound of his fall.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.480
But the impact never comes.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:15.880
When Pietro opens his eyes it is as if he
is hovering just above the ground.

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.390
He looks down at his feet.

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:22.590
The toes of the suit are firmly planted on
the floor like powerful magnets on iron.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:28.170
SCP-5000 has prevented his fall and is holding
him in place using the feet of the suit only.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.840
He reaches out his hand and gently places
it on the ground.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.770
He pushes himself up to a standing position.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:37.990
He turns to look back into the room, the men
are still in there searching for him.

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:40.680
Pietro makes his way back through Site-22.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:44.340
He walks by his office and proceeds towards
the exit of the facility.

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:49.540
As he passes the labs and other rooms at Site-22
all he finds is carnage.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:50.900
Everyone has been killed.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:54.900
An extra bullet has been placed in each person’s
head to make sure.

00:07:54.900 --> 00:08:00.460
It seems that the only mission these men were
on was to kill everyone, and make sure they

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.700
stayed dead.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:05.700
He continues towards the exit of Site-22 that
is guarded by two men.

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:10.400
As he approaches the two heavily armed men,
Pietro makes sure to be as quiet as possible.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:15.740
This is not a difficult task as the SCP-5000
has given him stealth capabilities.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:19.310
He notices that even his footsteps aren’t
giving off any sound.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:23.230
It is almost as if the suit is allowing him
to glide across the floor.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:27.050
He is almost to the exit, then he will be
home free.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:32.360
He takes a deep breath, turns sideways, and
squeezes past the two men guarding the doorway.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:37.690
Just as he is about to leave this nightmare
behind, one of the guards turns unexpectedly.

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:41.830
The man’s shoulder runs directly into Pietro
Wilson throwing him off balance.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:45.190
He is knocked into the second guard, both
of the men begin to scream.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.570
“What is that?” one of them shouts.

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:50.820
They begin to raise their guns on the invisible
object that just bumped into them.

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:55.250
It’s then that SCP-5000 takes over Pietro’s
body.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.430
The suit raises his arm and grabs one of the
men by the throat.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.820
With a squeeze the man’s larynx is instantly
crushed.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:03.980
Then the suit twists slightly and snaps the
man’s neck.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:05.760
It turns to face the second man.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:10.110
Even the black mask the man is weaning can’t
hide the look of terror on his face, but Pietro

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:11.750
has no control over what SCP-5000 is doing.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.720
He has never killed before.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:18.960
The suit launches Pietro’s body into the
second man, pinning him against the wall.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:24.060
It then grabs the top of the mercenary’s
head and slams it against the concrete again,

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:28.920
and again, and again, until the man’s screams
are silenced.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:33.770
The suit lets go of the man and his lifeless
body slides to the ground as Pietro blacks

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:34.770
out.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:39.300
When he regains consciousness, he’s outside
of Site-22 standing on top of a hill, looking

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.150
down at the facility below.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.540
He looks at his hands, then at the rest of
his body.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:47.050
He is still contained within SCP-5000.

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:49.830
There is a flash of light and a heads up display
comes on.

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:53.920
He doesn’t recognize any of the symbols,
but as his eyes move from one area of the

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:57.290
screen to the next, the symbols become highlighted.

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:00.860
Before his eyes certain symbols begin to translate
into words he can read.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:03.670
One of the symbols now says: Journal Entry.

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:07.660
Unsure of what else to do, Pietro begins recounting
what happened to him at Site-22.

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:12.460
He makes his way through the desert towards
the nearest SCP Foundation safe house.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:16.670
He knows once there he will be able to reach
out to his superiors for help and further

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:17.670
orders.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:21.330
Maybe he can even find a way to get SCP-5000
to release him.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:25.960
As he trudges along, Pietro Wilson notices
that his brain is telling him he is thirsty.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:29.420
But the vitals on the suit’s heads up display
say he is in good health.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.860
In fact, he is better than good, his vitals
are all perfect.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:36.339
The suit seems to be giving him all the nutrients
his body needs.

00:10:36.339 --> 00:10:39.880
It has even fixed his busted knee that was
injured back in college playing football.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:42.590
The joint itself has somehow been healed.

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:45.860
Pietro finally reaches the safe house and
opens the door.

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:47.310
It is quiet and dusty.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.680
It looks as if no one has been there in years.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:54.130
He walks over to the communications station
and tries to contact the Foundation but all

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.350
he gets is static.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:57.650
He gives up and walks over to the TV.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:00.730
He pushes the on button, the screen hisses
to life.

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:03.150
What he sees causes his jaw to drop.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:04.800
The world is at war.

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:08.320
A war between humans and monsters.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:13.240
Whatever happened at Site-22 also happened
at other Foundation sites.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.990
The SCPs have been let loose.

